# GitHub Actions workflow that refreshes docs/data/*.json on a schedule.
# The versioned copy lives in scripts/ci/ — GitHub's workflow scanner makes a
# push fail with "refusing to allow a GitHub App to create or update workflow"
# unless the pushing token has the `workflows` scope, so the file is copied into
# .github/workflows/ only on machines/accounts that have it:
#   mkdir -p .github/workflows && cp scripts/ci/weather-snapshot.yml .github/workflows/
.github/workflows/weather-snapshot.yml
